{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经curl JSON-RPC疑似EtherHiding命令控制。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Potential EtherHiding C2 via Curl JSON-RPC Request。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经curl JSON-RPC疑似EtherHiding命令控制","references":["https://notes.netbytesec.com/2026/08/anatomy-of-macos-clickfix-crimekit-that.html","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/dprk-adopts-etherhiding","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/unc5142-etherhiding-distribute-malware"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"54285d96-2b7c-4345-890e-3c40e173f099","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and\n  process.name in (\"curl\", \"nscurl\") and\n  process.parent.name in (\"osascript\", \"bash\", \"sh\", \"zsh\") and\n  process.command_line like~ (\"*eth_call*\", \"*\\\"jsonrpc\\\"*\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经curl JSON-RPC疑似EtherHiding命令控制\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远控通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1102","name":"Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1102.001","name":"Dead Drop Resolver","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/001/"},{"id":"T1102.002","name":"Bidirectional Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.002","name":"AppleScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/002/"},{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
